          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increase in short-term interest rates raises the cost of revolving credit and short-dated project financing for E&amp;P firms, causing firms and lenders to cut or delay upstream capital commitments and reducing net capital flows into the oil sector." />
