          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in global short-term interest rates tightens dollar and trade-finance liquidity and increases import financing costs for Iran-dependent firms, producing supply squeezes and price spikes that amplify domestic economic and political pressure." />
