          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sudden tightening of bond-market liquidity can create sovereign refinancing and fiscal stress that incentivizes governments to assert control over strategic energy assets or impose retroactive regulatory changes, increasing the probability of expropriation or adverse renegotiation for foreign owners." />
