          <attvalue for="33" value="-" />
          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A fall in bond market liquidity tightens short‑term trade finance and increases the cost/availability of maritime insurance and working capital for exporters, causing immediate reductions in the volume of agricultural exports that can be funded and shipped." />
